Part 3E.4 — Success Snackbar

Instead of a permanent success alert.

Add state:

const [showSuccess, setShowSuccess] =
  useState(false);

After save:

setShowSuccess(true);

Snackbar:

<Snackbar
  open={showSuccess}
  autoHideDuration={3000}
  onClose={() =>
    setShowSuccess(false)
  }
>
  <Alert severity="success">
    Members updated successfully.
  </Alert>
</Snackbar>
